    public void setTitle(String title);
    public String getTitle();
    public void setContent(String content);
    public String getContent();

    // AddContent method to add content to the document
    @Override
    protected void addContent(Node otherNode);

    // OutputSettings methods for different types of nodes
    public static OutputSettings getTitleOutputSettings();
    public static OutputSettings getContentOutputSettings();
}
```

The `Document` class represents a single document in the document system. It has fields to store the title and content of the document.

